# Normalise line endings so cross-platform agents cannot produce
# line-ending-only diffs. M01-W2-011: two .csproj files were rewritten
# entirely as CRLF, which made `git diff --check` fail and buried the one real
# project change in 56 lines of noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must not be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
